+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's cache eviction policy is LRU (Least Recently Used), with cached entries expiring via a 300-second TTL (time-to-live). This decision supersedes an earlier selection of LFU (Least Frequently Used), which is no longer in effect.
